// BLOCK 14B — INITIAL PUNCH SERVICE LOAD ON WORKSPACE ENTRY
//
// Operation: APPEND FORMULA.
// Target screen: scr_PunchReview
// Target property: OnVisible
// Exact location: append after the existing queue projection/current-record logic.
//
// Dependencies:
// - btnPR_SelectCurrent uses the latest Block 13B formula.
// - btnPR_LoadComments and btnPR_LoadCustomFields exist.
//
// Purpose:
// - When a queue has already been prepared by Punch List (or another source),
//   run the same centralized selection pipeline used inside Punch Review.
// - This causes initial Comments and Custom Fields to load for the active Punch.
// - It also makes return from Punch List refresh the active Punch services.
//
// Validation:
// 1. Enter from Punch List with a real loaded page.
// 2. The selected/first Punch is active immediately.
// 3. Comments load without clicking another queue row.
// 4. Custom Fields load without clicking another queue row.

If(
    CountRows(colPunchReviewQueue) > 0 &&
    !IsBlank(varPunchReviewCurrentId),

    Set(
        varPunchReviewRequestedIndex,
        varPunchReviewCurrentIndex
    );

    Select(btnPR_SelectCurrent)
)
